Package: kortix-capture
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Kortix
Homepage: https://kortix.com
Depends: libc6, systemd, util-linux, libglib2.0-bin, libx11-6, libxtst6, libxi6, libxrandr2, libxss1, libxcb1, libxdo3, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libayatana-appindicator3-1, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, ffmpeg, tesseract-ocr
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Description: Kortix Capture: records screen and actions, for you or your organization
 Records the screen (with text search), keyboard and mouse actions of an X11
 session and uploads them to the Kortix account the person signs in with, or
 that the organization enrolls the computer with. This package installs the
 recorder, the machine service kortix-capture-machine.service, and a user
 unit that runs in every session once /etc/kortix/capture.json exists.
